cated Display, Audio, Combat & HUD, and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T02:20:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183783195","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4982500-1840310314340276","game_id":"steam-4982500","kind":"announcement","title":"The SummonFall Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"Build. Summon. Survive the Fall.The free SummonFall Windows demo is now available on Steam.Battle through dangerous floors, collect loot, equip weapons and summons, choose skills and upgrades, and shape a build that can survive the Fall.The public demo currently uses version 0.1.0-demo.10.This is the beginning of developing SummonFall with players. After playing, please share bugs, balance feedback, UI issues, performance reports, and ideas in our official Discord:https://discord.gg/NKrAQPDyKYDo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T21:49:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314340276","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4982500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:48Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:47Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4982500":"2026-10-26T05:54:48Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4982500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5006250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:54:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4982500","app_id":4982500,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:14Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/I